# Keep Cursor's index lean — exclude generated, vendored, and large binary files.

# dependencies & build output
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/out/
**/build/

# design system handoff: large, vendored, not edited by hand.
# (The DS is the source of truth but Cursor doesn't need it in the index —
#  globals.css already mirrors the tokens. Un-ignore if you need to diff tokens.)
design-system/
ds-handoff.tar.gz

# fonts & generated assets
terminal/public/fonts/

# logs & misc
*.log
*.tsbuildinfo
